    "result_text": "Both tests pass. The change is implemented full-stack:\n\n- **Front-end** (`features/projects/feature.tsx`): the invoice form now validates the amount before submitting \u2014 a blank, non-numeric, zero, or negative value shows an `invoice-form-amount-error` message and adds no row; a positive amount clears the error and posts as before.\n- **Server** (`invoice/CreateInvoice.java`): tightened the guard from `signum() < 0` to `signum() <= 0` so the API rejects a zero (or negative) amount with `400 Bad Request`.\n- **Database** (`db/migration/V6__invoices_amount_positive.sql`): a new additive Flyway migration adds a `CHECK (amount > 0)` constraint as the final backstop.\n\nTests: `2 passed` \u2014 both the `@error` (rejects non-positive) and `@core` (accepts positive) cases.",
